    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An easy-to-follow story with SRPG tactics made in SRPG studio. Minimal experience with SPRG's needed to play it! Follow the story of Innes in world that's on its last legs due to gods plan to rebuild the world. Even if it would save the world follow as Innes fights for humanity.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been in ruin for too long so one of the Gods employs his disciples to gather the necessary artifacts to finally have the world reborn. Innes has hope still that there's chance for humanity to turn it around now it's on her hands to make that come true even if others may disagree...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >33 playable characters + 3 secret recruitables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 medium sized maps + 6 side chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every class is playable besides monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom soundtrack (1)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed character cutscenes (most at endgame, in development could change)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An easy-to-follow story with SRPG tactics made in SRPG studio. Minimal experience with SPRG's needed to play it! Follow the story of Innes in world that's on its last legs due to gods plan to rebuild the world. Even if it would save the world follow as Innes fights for humanity.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been in ruin for too long so one of the Gods employs his disciples to gather the necessary artifacts to finally have the world reborn. Innes has hope still that there's chance for humanity to turn it around now it's on her hands to make that come true even if others may disagree...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >33 playable characters + 3 secret recruitables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 medium sized maps + 6 side chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every class is playable besides monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom soundtrack (1)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed character cutscenes (most at endgame, in development could change)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
